Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look. It's the woman we ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:55.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看，这是我们订的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. Can, uh... Can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，需要帮忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. No, thanks. I'm just waiting for, uh, Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用，谢谢，我在等乔伊崔比亚尼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Joey Tribbiani.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是乔伊崔比亚尼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Oh, no, not you. Big Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔，不是你，是老乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're so much cuter than your pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你比照片上帅多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Ronni.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是罗妮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:24.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cheese Nip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:24.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想吃起起司片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Joey's having an embolism...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊的脑子有点秀逗了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'd go for a Nip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我要起司片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, most people, when their pets pass on...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大部分人在宠物过世后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they want them laid out like they're sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望他们像睡觉那样躺着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But occasionally you get a person who wants them in a pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有时有些人要他们摆出姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like, uh, chasing their tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像追自己的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or, uh, jumping to catch a Frisbee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或跳起来接住飞盘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, if I go first, I want to be looking for my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊，如果我先走一步 我的姿势要像找钥匙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's a good one. - Hey, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:02.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好好笑！ - 嗨！乔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Dad. Ronni's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨，爸爸，罗妮来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Huh? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:07.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are...? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, uh, you left your hair at my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的假发留在我的住处
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I figured you'd need it for your meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你明天开会用得上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who's up for a big game of Kerplunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁想玩大老二
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，我…
