Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta go. I'll miss the last train.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该走了，我不想错过最后一班地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't want you taking that thing this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:38.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我不想让你这么晚还搭地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:41.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Where am I gonna stay? Here? - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:41.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 那我要睡哪里  这里吗  - 喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll go to a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们去住饭店
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll go to a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们去住饭店
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, you won't. - No, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不行 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you go to a hotel, you'll be doing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们去饭店就一定会嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:55.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want you right here, where I can keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:55.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你们待在这里 这样我就可以盯着你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna keep an eye on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要盯着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care how old you are, while you're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不管你年纪多大 只要住在我家屋檐下…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're gonna live by my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切就得听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that means no sleeping with your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是不准你和 你女朋友睡在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, he's strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇，他好严格
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, you'll be in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸，你睡我房问
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ronni, uh, you can stay in Chandler's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗妮 你睡钱德的房问
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. You're a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 你真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. I'll show you to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来，我带你去看我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That sounds weird when it's not followed by, "No, thanks, it's late."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉真奇怪 你没说 〝不，谢了，时候不早了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. This is just for tonight. Starting tomorrow, you gotta change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，只有今晚而已 明天你就得做出改变
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Six years is long enough. - What kind of change?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 六年时间可不短 - 什么改变？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Break up with Ronni... - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 和罗妮分手 - 我不能！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then come clean with Ma. This is not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不就和我妈离婚 这样是不对的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:48.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna hear it. Now go to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:48.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对，但是… - 我不想听，快进我房里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, kickie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，踢踏舞者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:09.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you doing? - Trying to get comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:09.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你在干什么？ - 想让自己舒服一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I can't sleep in my underwear. - Well, you're gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 穿着内裤我睡不着 - 你非穿不可
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:20.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在想…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:24.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about how I'm always seeing girls on top of girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:24.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我总是看见女人叠在女人上面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:30.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are they end-to-end, or tall, like pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:30.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们是尾对尾相接 还是是像煎饼一样叠起来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what I mean. How I date all these women.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我什么意思 这些和我约过会的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I always figured, when the right one comes along...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我总是想 当真命天女出现时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'll be able to be a standup guy and go the distance, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:40.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就会勇往直前，坚持到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I'm looking at my Dad thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如今看见我爸 我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not him, you're you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是他，你是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When they wanted you to go into your father's business, did you cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当他们希望你继承你爸的事业时 你有屈服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:51.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:51.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没有 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You decided to go into the out-of-work-actor business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你决心从事没有工作的 演艺事业
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't easy, but you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:58.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是一件容易的事 但你办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I believe that when the right woman comes along...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也相信 当真命天女出现时
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:04.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll have the guts to say:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:04.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会有勇气对她说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"No thanks, I'm married."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝抱歉，我已婚〞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的这样认为
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的，我真的这样认为
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Thanks, Chandler. - Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 谢谢，钱德 - 滚开
