Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:37.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, Joey said I could use your shower since, uh, Chandler's in ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:37.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊说我能用你的浴室 因为钱德正在用我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, uh, I'm Ronni. Ronni Rapalono. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫罗妮 罗妮·罗普拉诺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情妇？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Um, come on in. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 请进 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm Rachel. Bathroom's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫瑞秋，浴室在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Ronni.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，听好，罗妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How long has Chandler been in the shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德进浴室多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Like, uh, five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大约五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:04.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fasten your seat belts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:04.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请系好安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it's pee-pee time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看小鸡鸡的时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Mr. Trib.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，崔比亚尼先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. Good morning, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿，早安，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:20.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler Bing, it's time to see your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:20.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德宾，该换我看你的小东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What's the matter with you? - I thought it was Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你是怎么搞的  - 我以为你是钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were supposed to be in there so I could see your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该在浴室 这样我才能看见你的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, my thing was in there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，我的小东西在里面 和我在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PHOEBE: Hey. ALL: Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嘿 - 嘿，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: How's it going? - Good. Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还好吧？ - 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Roger's having a dinner thing and he wanted me to invite you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗杰想邀大家一起吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So, what's going on? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just that, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是罗杰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, ahem, I don't know. There's something about... Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道，有些事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Basically, we just feel that he's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本上我们认为他…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We hate that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们讨厌他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:17.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:17.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们讨厌他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're sorry, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 菲此，我们很抱歉 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯哼，对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you think maybe it's just that he's so perceptive...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是不是他太有洞察力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that it freaked you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以吓到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, I hate him. - No, we hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我们讨厌他…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:29.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.80,0:16:29.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ma. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈，你来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I came to give you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把这个带给你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and this. - Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Big ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的大戒指打到很痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why did you fill your father's head with that garbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要对你爸讲一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about making things right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于改邪归正的废话呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Things were fine the way they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 切事情本来都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's chicken in there. Put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面有鸡肉，放冰箱冰好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:05.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, Joey. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:05.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，乔伊，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on. You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，你都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I knew. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然知道  你认为呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:14.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your father is no James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:14.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爸又不是詹姆士庞德
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should have heard his cover stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该听听他的谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I'm sleeping over at my accountant's."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我在会计家里睡〞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what is that? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么屁话 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So then, how could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎能…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you remember how your father used to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得你爸以前的模样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Always yelling. Nothing made him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总是大呼大叫，总是不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:34.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that wood shop, not those stupid little ships in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:34.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连工作室和 瓶内的小船也无法让他开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now he's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在他很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it's nice. He has a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样很好，他好歹有个嗜好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ma, I don't mean to be disrespectful, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈，我无意冒犯 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:47.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:47.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I mean, what about you? - Me? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我是说，那你怎么办？ - 我很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，亲爱的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in an ideal world...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在理想的世界中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there'd be no her and your father would look like Sting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有她 而且你爸是个大帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'll tell you something else:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再告诉你别的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:07.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ever since that poodle-stuffer came along...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:07.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从那贵妇犬一样的女人出现后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:11.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he's been so ashamed of himself that he's been more attentive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:11.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他感觉很羞耻 变得对我很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:13.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's been more loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:13.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并且开始对我体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like every day is our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每天都像我们的结婚纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm happy for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.33,0:18:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该为你高兴？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不必了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:23.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because now everything's screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:23.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为现在全搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:29.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want it the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:29.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想回到像从前一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}JOEY: Ma, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:36.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just did what I thought you'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:36.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为我做了你想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:40.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you did, cookie. Oh, I know you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:40.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，亲爱的，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:44.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:44.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你见到她了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}见到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:53.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're 10 times prettier than she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:53.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你比她漂亮十倍都不止
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘴巴真甜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could I take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我打得过她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With this ring, no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有这么大的戒指，她没辙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROGER: What's wrong, sweetie? PHOEBE: Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 怎么了 甜心 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. What's wrong? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底怎么了 快说嘛
